# Machine-readable citation metadata (Citation File Format 1.2.0), so a tool
# or an agent asked to cite this work has an answer that does not have to be
# guessed. The request behind it is `doc/attribution.md`.
#
# No version or release date: those move through
# `scripts/release/sync_version.py` and would go stale here unnoticed. Cite
# the repository, and the commit if you need to be exact.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, its register maps, or the measurements in its
  device wiki, please cite the project.
title: Sungrow-SHx-Inverter-Modbus-Home-Assistant
abstract: >-
  A Home Assistant integration and Python library for Sungrow hybrid
  inverters, their SBR and SBH batteries, the iHomeManager, the AC wallbox and
  the SG string inverters over Modbus TCP, directly or through a WiNet-S
  dongle. Its register maps and its device wiki are measured on real
  installations and recorded against the firmware each finding holds on.
